            <img id="postchat-intentional-img" src="{! URLFOR($Resource.AFIBrandLogo) }" class="illustration" style="display: none" width="50"/>
            <img id="postchat-unintentional-img" src="{! URLFOR($Resource.AFIBrandLogo) }" class="illustration" style="display: none" width="50"/>
        </div>-->
        <div id="postchat-intentional-text" class="center">
            <h1>Terima Kasih Telah Menggunakan</h1><br/>
            <h1>Layanan Live Chat</h1>
            <!--<p>Anda dapat menutup halaman ini sekarang.</p>
            <p>Untuk meningkatkan kualitas layanan kami, mohon dibantu saran dan masukannya</p>
            <p>dengan klik tombol <b>Survey</b>. Jika Anda ingin membaca riwayat obrolan,</p>
            <p>silakan klik tombol <b>Unduh Riwayat Obrolan</b></p>-->
          	<!--<p>Thank you for reaching AXA Financial Indonesia Customer Support. You may close this page now.</p>
          	<p>However, If you would like to read the chat transcript, click the <b>Download Chat Transcript</b> button below. please click the <b>Survey</b> button to give me feedback.</p>-->
          	<br/><br/><br/><img id="chat-brand-image" src="https://c.ap4.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0156F00000HPeZF&oid=00D90000000zAlz&lastMod=1551859137000" width="170"/>
        </div>
        <div id="postchat-unintentional-text" class="center" style="display: none">
